WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:02.368
(audience applauds)

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.701
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:07.034
- [Kelly Clarkson] Nice to see you!

00:00:07.034 --> 00:00:07.997
Hi!

00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:09.368
- [Dani Beck] Thank you.
Thank you for having us.

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:11.021
- [Kelly Clarkson] Aw,
thank you for coming!

00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:11.854
(audience applauding)

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:13.030
- [Kelly Clarkson] So
I forget y'all probably

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.140
haven't seen each other in a minute

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.710
'cause you did this so long ago, right?

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:16.543
- [Ben] Straight up.

00:00:16.543 --> 00:00:17.376
- [Kelly Clarkson] Okay I was gonna say,

00:00:17.376 --> 00:00:18.410
I was just thinking that- y'all hugging,

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.290
I was like oh wait, y'all.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.297
We always think it's
like y'all just did it

00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:22.030
but obviously was done a long time ago.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.125
- We shot it like during COVID

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:25.222
and so we had all been isolated

00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:26.704
in our own homes for like months

00:00:26.704 --> 00:00:28.570
and then we got to have
this beautiful moment

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.736
where we were all together
and getting to see each other

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:31.852
and spend time together.

00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:34.720
And so now I think we all
feel that very kind of

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.701
special connection when we
(indistinct) each other.

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:39.330
- Well Dani, we know
you from cop shows like

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.440
Cold Case and Law and Order:

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.671
SVU, which I always say
SUV, I don't know why.

00:00:42.671 --> 00:00:43.504
- Everybody does.

00:00:43.504 --> 00:00:44.462
- [Kelly Clarkson] Everytime and I'm like-

00:00:44.462 --> 00:00:45.530
- [Dani Beck] Everybody does!

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.004
what's happening.

00:00:47.004 --> 00:00:47.907
I always say SUV and
they're like, "Not a car".

00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:51.830
Have you- have you done a
musical like this before?

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.380
- Not quite like this, no.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.935
But I did play Desi Arnaz
and so I had to sing.

00:00:56.935 --> 00:00:58.879
- [Kelly Clarkson] What a cool role.

00:00:58.879 --> 00:00:59.712
- An amazing role.

00:00:59.712 --> 00:01:00.545
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:00.545 --> 00:01:02.000
- Being Cuban American,
it was very personal.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:02.833
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah!

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:04.211
But never quite like this.

00:01:04.211 --> 00:01:05.184
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:05.184 --> 00:01:06.837
Oh my God, I grew up on I love Lucy.

00:01:06.837 --> 00:01:09.821
So, and Nick, we know you
from Atypical on Netflix,

00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:10.654
so have you-

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:11.487
(crowd applauding and cheering)

00:01:11.487 --> 00:01:14.320
- [Kelly Clarkson] I
know! It's very popular.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.880
And it's also not a musical show.

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.290
So have you- is this new for you?

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:18.373
- Oh, yeah, yes.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.210
Yeah I'm not a singer or a dancer.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:25.290
- [Kelly Clarkson] So you're
going to do great. (laughs)

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.000
- They whipped me into
shape. I went through-

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.830
- Well what was it like
then singing next to-

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.330
Ben's one of literally
the best male vocalist

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:32.163
I've ever heard.

00:01:32.163 --> 00:01:32.996
So like, what was it like?

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:34.363
And I've sung with him before.

00:01:34.363 --> 00:01:36.861
What was it like singing with
them then, were you terrified?

00:01:36.861 --> 00:01:38.265
- Oh my God, yeah.

00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:41.200
Uh, well because I don't (indistinct)

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.230
they had set up private
sessions for me to,

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.362
you know, help with that and uhh

00:01:45.362 --> 00:01:46.854
(laughter)

00:01:46.854 --> 00:01:49.177
And during my first one with
the music director in Atlanta,

00:01:49.177 --> 00:01:51.823
it was just supposed to
be two of us, very chill.

00:01:51.823 --> 00:01:54.309
Ben walks in to say hello,
cause we hadn't met yet.

00:01:54.309 --> 00:01:56.840
And he was very sweet. Hi,
how are you, all that stuff?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.070
And the music director was like,

00:01:58.070 --> 00:01:59.720
why don't you guys sing together?

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.553
- [Kelly Clarkson] Oh no..

00:02:01.553 --> 00:02:03.666
- I don't know if you could
tell, but I was panicking.

00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:05.110
- Well, you were wonderful.

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:06.572
And he's also wonderful in the movies.

00:02:06.572 --> 00:02:08.043
So he's being very humble.

